title: no_good_deeds_go_unpunished
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands beggar_innocent>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "No Good Deeds Go Unpunished">>
You come across a beggar sitting beside the road, holding out a worn cup.
Beggar: "Please, traveler. Spare a coin for the less fortunate."
-> Give him money #paneldetails=Lose_100_Gold._Gain_15_Light.
    <<if gold() >= 100>>
        <<change_gold -100>><<change_light 15>>
        You drop some Gold into the beggar's cup.
        Beggar: "Ooh! May the goddess bless you for your kindness."
        <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump no_good_deeds_broke>>
    <<endif>>
-> Ignore him #paneldetails=Lose_10_Light.
    You pay no attention to him, ignoring his pleas.
    Beggar: "May damnation befall your selfish self!"
    His words sting your heart as you leave him behind.
    <<change_light -10>>
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
-> [gold]Observe him[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight
    <<spend_insight 1>>
    <<jump no_good_deeds_insight_safe>>
===

title: no_good_deeds_insight_safe
---
You study the beggar meticulously before making your decision.
[pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/]  [br/][green]He appears to be genuinely desperate.[/green]
-> Give him money #paneldetails=Lose_100_Gold._Gain_15_Light.
    <<if gold() >= 100>>
        <<change_gold -100>><<change_light 15>>
        You drop some Gold into the beggar's cup.
        Beggar: "Ooh! May the goddess bless you for your kindness."
        <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump no_good_deeds_broke>>
    <<endif>>
-> Don't give him anything #paneldetails=Lose_10_Light.
    You decide not to give anything and leave the beggar to his misfortune.
    Beggar: "May damnation befall your selfish self!"
    His words sting your heart as you leave him behind.
    <<change_light -10>>
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===

title: no_good_deeds_ominous
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands beggar_innocent>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "No Good Deeds Go Unpunished">>
You come across a beggar sitting beside the road, holding out a worn cup.
Beggar: "Please, traveler. Spare a coin for the less fortunate."
-> Give him money #paneldetails=Lose_100_Gold._Gain_15_Light.
    <<if gold() >= 100>>
        <<change_gold -100>>
        As you reach for your coin pouch, the beggar's posture suddenly changes.
        <<picture YarnCommands beggar_evil>>
        <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<sfx YarnCommands hit>><<flash YarnCommands red 0.3>>
        <<change_health_percent -30>>
        The beggar drives a hidden blade into you.
        <<sfx YarnCommands chaosoccurs>>
        Beggar: "Ha! Fool! Easy pickings!"
        <<lose_all_gold>>
        As you writhe in shock and pain, he snatches the rest of your Gold and disappears into the wilderness.
        <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump no_good_deeds_broke_ominous>>
    <<endif>>
-> Ignore him #paneldetails=Lose_10_Light.
    You pay no attention to him, ignoring his pleas.
    Beggar: "May damnation befall your selfish self!"
    His words sting your heart as you leave him behind.
    [pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/]
    Beggar: "Tch..."
    <<change_light -10>>
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
-> [gold]Observe him[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight
    <<spend_insight 1>>
    <<jump no_good_deeds_insight_ominous>>
===

title: no_good_deeds_insight_ominous
---
You study the beggar meticulously before making your decision.
[pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/].[pause=0.5/]  [br/][red]You spot a hidden dagger beneath his robes.[/red]
-> Take him out #paneldetails=Gain_400_Gold._Gain_1_Arcana.
    <<sfx YarnCommands hit>><<flash YarnCommands red 0.3>>
    You quickly dispatch the beggar before he can react.
    As he clutches his slit throat, you look through his possessions.
    Pouches of Gold and a magic tome. Probably stolen.
    "If you steal, you must expect to be stolen from."
    Heh, how ironic.
    You take his possessions and carry on with your journey. 
    <<change_gold 400>><<change_arcana 1>>
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
-> Call out his ploy #paneldetails=Gain_1_Wisdom._Gain_10_Light.
    <<change_wisdom 1>><<change_light 10>>
    The beggar notices that you have seen through him.
    You warn him not to do anything foolish.
    Beggar: "F-fine... I won't do anything..."
    He runs away into the wilderness.
    You feel quite fulfilled by this act of mercy.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===

title: no_good_deeds_broke
---
The beggar glances at your empty coin pouch and lowers his cup.
Beggar: "Ahh... So you have suffered the same fate as us..."
You move on, unable to offer anything.
<<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===

title: no_good_deeds_broke_ominous
---
The beggar glances at your empty coin pouch and lowers his cup.
Beggar: "Bah! You're broke as shit!"
Beggar: "Get lost! You're useless to me."
You move on, grateful he didn't do anything worse.
<<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===
